# Technical stack
- Turborepo for monorepo and build system
- PNPM for package manager
- NextJS for the frontend framework
- Radix UI for design system component
- Storybook for design system documentation
- TailwindCSS v3 for CSS framework
- Separate databases for dev, test, and prod
